00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:24.400
If you kill her, then it initiates one of the major endgame bossfights early

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:27.960
which leads to an endgame area if you can kill the boss,

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:29.920
