00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:11.360
Number 5

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:16.160
So, fast forwarding to the Undead Settlement. There's this really secret covenant

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:20.800
that you can join, but you have to do it before killing The Cursed Greatwood.

00:02:21.260 --> 00:02:27.320
Turn right at the burning tree, go across the bridge and then go around the right side of the building, through these barrels.

00:02:27.320 --> 00:02:33.200
Climb the ladder and run along the rooftops to the right. Below, you will see a cage carrier,

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:37.120
but as long as you haven't killed the Cursed Greatwood, he's non-hostile.

00:02:37.480 --> 00:02:44.120
So, walk up behind him and, ya know, do the logical thing, and climb into his cage, get thrown down into a pit,

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:48.920
crawl out of your cage, and talk to Hodric to join the Mound Maker's covenant.

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:53.700
Mound Makers drop a white or red sign, but it appears purple.

00:02:53.980 --> 00:03:00.140
So, if someone summons you with this sign, then you can either kill the enemies in their world and help them,

00:03:00.460 --> 00:03:04.240
or you can kill the host or their phantom for the reward.

00:03:04.440 --> 00:03:07.000
Alright, between us, here is what we're gonna do.

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:11.220
When the game first comes out, no one's going to know what these purple signs do.

00:03:11.220 --> 00:03:14.480
So, put on a white summon ring that you get from Yuria,

00:03:14.480 --> 00:03:16.720
get summoned into someone's world, and just

00:03:16.720 --> 00:03:20.080
kill all the enemies, help them out, and be friendly, wave at them

00:03:20.440 --> 00:03:22.400
and then, once you've gained their trust

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:27.180
turn on them, when the time is right, backstab them when their health is low, or something like that

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:32.600
Eventually, you'll get 10 Vertebrae Shackles, and these can be handed in for a new katana

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:34.940
called Bloodlust, which I've heard is good

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:38.520
or 30 shackles rewards you with the Warmth spell

