nr. 7

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:15.020
Did you know that some enemies are ridiculously weak to fire?

00:04:15.220 --> 00:04:22.220
for example, dogs, tree hollows, both of those will writhe on the ground if you hit them with any fire damage at all

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:25.840
which, pretty much guarantees you a kill after the first hit

00:04:25.840 --> 00:04:28.960
the best example of this though, are those maggot monsters

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:32.680
who are completely incapacitated by fire

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:35.340
so pull out the torch every time you face against them

00:04:35.660 --> 00:04:38.120
without this knowledge of fire, they are really tough

00:04:38.120 --> 00:04:43.960
because they cover you in maggots, and your bleed meter will rise for a ridiculous stretch of time

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:50.020
but don't worry, if you do get covered in maggots, simply pull out your torch and they'll fly off

